ma":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false},"execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"}},{"name":"cutaste_eval_report","description":"读取 session 汇总或 evaluation 单票报告。session 的 resumableTasks 返回仍可披露、规则未变、未完成票据的 instruction/outputDirectory/target，用于恢复原会话；取消后不返回可续跑任务。外部执行失败明确为 assistant-reported。已完成页面返回 visualAssessmentRequest 和 requirementAssessmentRequest（本次冻结准则与需求、四图本机path/hash、requestHash）供宿主实际看图评分。每次重查隐私/披露资格，程序检查与模型判断、本人反馈分列。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"session":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"evaluation":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"language":{"default":"zh","type":"string","enum":["zh","en"]}},"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false},"execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"}},{"name":"cutaste_eval_cancel","description":"停止此会话接受新产物；已完成结果保留。正在运行的本地检查会结束但不再计入会话。Stop accepting new submissions without deleting prior results.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"session":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"language":{"default":"zh","type":"string","enum":["zh","en"]}},"required":["session"],"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false},"execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"}},{"name":"cutaste_context_tasks","description":"领取当前来源编程助手的少量待提取原话；在当前会话